# Indexer-specific exclusions (gitignore syntax), layered on top of SocratiCode's
# built-in defaults and .gitignore.
#
# Vendored agent skills are read-only third-party content, not this project's
# code: ~247 of the ~282 indexable files on disk, i.e. ~87% of embedding time,
# for material no one asks semantic questions about. They also pollute results —
# a query about the worker's command handling should not surface obra-superpowers
# markdown. ruff (extend-exclude) and ty ([tool.ty.src] exclude) already skip
# this tree; this keeps the indexer consistent with them.
#
# The skills themselves stay readable — they are plain files a few directories
# away, and docs/SKILLS.md is registered as a context artifact.
skills-vendor/
skills/
.claude/skills/

# Local mirror of the private cannobserv package index. Already covered by
# .gitignore, listed here so the exclusion survives RESPECT_GITIGNORE=false.
.wheelhouse/

# Content-addressed fetched bytes — opaque blobs, never source.
blobs/
